# Cascade Pipeline Architecture Rules

## 1. Core architecture

Maintain a modular cascaded architecture:

Audio Input
    |
    v
Audio Preprocessing
    |
    v
ASR Engine
    |
    v
Transcript Candidates
    |
    v
NLU Engine
    |
    v
Failure Diagnosis
    |
    v
Recovery Controller
    |
    v
Dialogue Decision
    |
    v
Response Generation

Each stage must have a clearly defined responsibility.

## 2. Separation of concerns

Keep the following components independent:

- Audio loading and preprocessing
- ASR inference
- Transcript candidate generation
- NLU inference
- Semantic frame extraction
- Failure diagnosis
- Recovery policy
- Pipeline orchestration
- Evaluation and metrics
- Experiment tracking

Do not combine the entire pipeline into a single Python file.

